  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "とくしゅな　どくえきを　あびせかける。\nどく　じょうたいの　あいては\nこうげき　とくこう　すばやさが　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "특수한 독액을 끼얹는다.\n독 상태인 상대는\n공격, 특수공격, 스피드가 떨어진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "向對手發射特殊的毒液。\n陷入中毒狀態的對手\n攻擊、特攻和速度會降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sécrète un liquide empoisonné.\nDiminue l’Attaque, l’Attaque Spéciale et la Vitesse\nde l’ennemi empoisonné.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender bespritzt das Ziel mit einer speziellen\nGiftflüssigkeit. Senkt den Angriff, den Spezial-Angriff\nund die Initiative von vergifteten Zielen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Impregna a su objetivo con un líquido venenoso que\ndisminuye el Ataque, el Ataque Especial y la Velocidad.\nSolo afecta a Pokémon ya envenenados.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Emette un liquido particolare che riduce\nl’Attacco, l’Attacco Speciale e la Velocità\ndei nemici avvelenati intorno a chi la usa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Opposing Pokémon are drenched in an odd\npoisonous liquid. This lowers the Attack, Sp. Atk, and\nSpeed stats of a poisoned target.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "特殊な　毒液を　浴びせかける。\n毒状態の　相手は\n攻撃　特攻　素早さが　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将特殊的毒液泼向对手。\n对处于中毒状态的对手，\n其攻击、特攻和速度都会降低。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Impregna a su objetivo con un líquido venenoso que\ndisminuye el Ataque, el Ataque Especial y la Velocidad.\nSolo afecta a Pokémon ya envenenados.",
      "version_group": {
